  "description": "<p>The task here is five-fold:</p>\n\n<p>1) Remove all karaf dependencies on fcrepo-camel-toolbox.  It is only necessary in this first round of updates to cover the services that are currently in highest demand:  fcrepo,fcrepo-indexing-solr and fcrepo-indexing-triplestore.<br/>\n2) Upgrade camel to use the latest camel version (3.9.0)<br/>\n3) Reorganize the camel toolbox so that it can be executed as a stand-alone Java 11 jar.<br/>\n4) Add support for a -c &lt;properties file path&gt; in order to configure your camel microservices.<br/>\n5) Add the ability to enable select services (such as Solr or triplestore indexing) via the properties file.</p>",
